Z||000001||Songman||04-25-2001||06:13 PM||||The one I am thinking of is not really a wraparound spoiler. It does have tips that 'wrap around' but it all sits on the trunk and is one piece. Most true wraparound spoilers are three piece. <P>The spoilers look pretty good and I was going to put one on my coupe. They wouldn't look good with aero cars in my opinion.<P>The one that I found was on a 1993 model so anything close to that...<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
